  - tag: CollectHuman
    description: Collects Human resource each turn
  - tag: CollectEnergy
    description: Collects Energy resource each turn
  - tag: CollectMaterials
    description: Collects Materials resource each turn
  - tag: CollectTech
    description: Collects Tech resource each turn
